Package: cdex-base
Architecture: amd64
Depends: binfmt-support,
         dbus-x11,
         fontconfig,
         gtk2-engines-pixbuf,
         libnss-myhostname,
         libnss-resolve,
         lightdm,
         lightdm-gtk-greeter,
         openbox,
         polkitd,
         python3,
         spice-vdagent,
         systemd-resolved,
         wine (>= 11.15.0-1cd),
         wmctrl,
         x11-utils,
         x11-xserver-utils,
         xdotool,
         xorg,
         xterm,
         yad,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: CDEX, a Windows-like desktop environment (base)
 CDEX (CusDeb Desktop Environment X) aims to give users a classic Windows
 experience. It is built on Win32 and uses the PE binary format, but is
 designed to run on Unix-like operating systems.

Package: mspaint
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Simple image editor and drawing application
 Mspaint is a free and open-source reimplementation of MS Paint. It aims to
 be easy to use, offering just enough functionality for everyday tasks such
 as drawing simple graphics and touching up images.
 .
 This package is part of the CDEX desktop environment.

Package: cdex-calc
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Simple and scientific calculator
 Calc is a calculator application. It provides:
 .
  - standard arithmetic with memory functions and square root
  - a scientific mode with trigonometric, logarithmic, and bitwise
    operations in decimal, hexadecimal, octal, and binary bases
  - a conversion mode for converting between units such as angles
 .
 This package is part of the CDEX desktop environment.

Package: winmine
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Minesweeper game
 Winmine is a game where the player finds hidden mines without setting them
 off.
 .
 This package is part of the CDEX desktop environment.

Package: spider
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Spider solitaire card game
 Spider is a solitaire card game played with two decks. The goal is to arrange
 all cards into descending same-suit sequences from King to Ace.
 .
 This package is part of the CDEX desktop environment.

Package: cdex-full
Section: metapackages
Architecture: amd64
Depends: cdex-base,
         cdex-calc,
         mspaint,
         spider,
         winmine,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: Meta-package for CDEX, a Windows-like desktop environment
 CDEX (CusDeb Desktop Environment X) aims to give users a classic Windows
 experience. It is built on Win32 and uses the PE binary format, but is
 designed to run on Unix-like operating systems.
 .
 This package is a metapackage; it depends on both the core packages of the
 CDEX desktop environment and some extra CDEX packages.
